# P-006-5: the multicolumn and break properties in servo mode (ui4me 015 FRAG-2a, register UP-09; lane L-FRAG, AUTHORISATIONS E-029): `column-fill`, `column-rule-color|style|width` and the `column-rule` shorthand behind the pref layout.css.columns.enabled (like `column-count`); `break-before`, `break-after`, `break-inside` and the legacy `page-break-*` shorthands enabled; `break-before|after` gain the CSS Break 3 values `column`, `avoid-column` and `avoid-page` (not valid in the legacy shorthands)
